{"attribution":"Federal Emergency Management Agency, Ready.gov, Winter Weather, Simplified Chinese; no FEMA, DHS, or U.S. Government endorsement or affiliation is implied.","cases":[{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-001","input":"冬季风暴会增加发生车祸、体温过低、冻伤、一氧化碳中毒和因过度劳累引起的心脏病的风险。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-001","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-002","input":"包括暴风雪在内的冬季风暴会带来极冷、冻雨、大雪、冰冻和大风。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-002","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-003","input":"持续数小时或数天。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-003","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-004","input":"切断供热、供电和通讯服务。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-004","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-005","input":"使长者、儿童、病人和宠物面临更大的风险。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-005","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-006","input":"如果即将或正在发生的冬季大雪、大冻雨或大雨夹雪会出现危险，就好发出。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-006","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-007","input":"冬季风暴警告通常在事件预计开始前 12 至 24 小时发布。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-007","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-008","input":"提醒公众注意可能发生暴风雪、大雪、强冻雨或大雨夹雪。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-008","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-009","input":"冬季风暴观察通常在冬季风暴开始前 12 至 48 小时发布。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-009","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-010","input":"因积雪、冻雨、冻毛毛雨和雨夹雪会造成重大不便而发出，如果不采取谨慎措施，可能会导致危及生命的情况。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-010","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-011","input":"注意天气报告和冰冻天气和冬季风暴的警告。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-011","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-012","input":"收听紧急信息和警示。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-012","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-013","input":"注册社区警告系统。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-013","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-014","input":"紧急警示系统 (EAS) 和国家海洋和大气管理局 (NOAA) 气象无线电也提供紧急情况警示。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-014","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-015","input":"将住房绝缘、填缝和密封，做好御寒准备。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-015","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-016","input":"了解如何防止管道冻结。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-016","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-017","input":"安装和测试带有备用电池的烟雾报警器和一氧化碳探测器。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-017","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-018","input":"收集用品，以防家中停电几天之需。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-018","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-019","input":"切记每个人的特定需求，包括药物。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-019","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-020","input":"切记宠物的需求。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-020","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-021","input":"为收音机和手电筒准备额外的电池。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-021","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-022","input":"在家中、单位和汽车防备冬季天气。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-022","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-023","input":"在车中准备一个应急用品包。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-023","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-024","input":"包括跨接电缆、沙子、手电筒、御寒衣服、被褥、瓶装水和不易变质的零食。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-024","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-025","input":"留一箱满的汽油。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-025","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-026","input":"避免一氧化碳中毒。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-026","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-027","input":"仅在室外且远离窗户的地方使用发电机和烤架。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-027","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-028","input":"切勿使用燃气炉灶或烤箱为住房供暖。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-028","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-029","input":"切勿使用燃气炉或烤箱在家中取暖。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-029","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-030","input":"使用烤箱或燃气炉也会增加火灾和烧伤的风险，并可能损坏电器。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-030","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-031","input":"尽可能远离道路。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-031","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-032","input":"如被困在车内，应待在车内。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-032","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-033","input":"限制在室外的时间。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-033","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-034","input":"如需外出，应多穿几层保暖的衣服。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-034","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-035","input":"注意是否有冻伤和体温过低的迹象。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-035","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-036","input":"铲雪和在雪中行走时，应避免用力过度，以减少心脏发作的风险。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-036","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-037","input":"冻伤会导致面部、手指和脚趾周围失去感觉和颜色。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-037","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-038","input":"迹象：麻木、白色或灰黄色的皮肤及紧实或蜡质皮肤。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-038","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-039","input":"行动：去温暖的房间。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-039","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-040","input":"不要按摩或使用加热垫。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-040","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-041","input":"体温过低就是异常低的体温。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-041","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-042","input":"温度低于 95 度就属于紧急情况。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-042","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-043","input":"迹象：颤抖、疲惫、困惑、双手摸索、记忆力减退、口齿不清或困倦。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-043","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-044","input":"首先温暖身体的中心：胸部、颈部、头部和腹股沟。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-044","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-045","input":"保持干燥并用温暖的毯子包裹，包括头部和颈部。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-045","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-046","input":"停电时，发电机会很有帮助。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-046","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-047","input":"了解如何安全使用它们以防止一氧化碳(CO)中毒和其他危害非常重要。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-047","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-048","input":"发电机和燃料应始终在室外使用，并且距离窗户、门和附属车库至少20英尺。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-048","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-049","input":"在您家的每一层都安装工作的一氧化碳探测器。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-049","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-050","input":"一氧化碳是一种无色无味的气体，对您、您的家人和宠物有致命的危险。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-050","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-051","input":"保持发电机干燥并防止雨淋或水浸。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-051","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-052","input":"触摸潮湿的发电机或与之相连的设备可能会导致触电。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-052","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-053","input":"始终使用重型延长线将发电机连接到电器。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-053","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-054","input":"加油前让发电机冷却。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-054","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-055","input":"洒在热发动机部件上的燃油会着火。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-055","split":"article"}},{"classification":{"domain":null,"risk":null,"status":"needs_input_only_review"},"id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1/sentence-056","input":"仔细遵循制造商的说明。","provenance":{"raw_url":"https://www.ready.gov/zh-hans/winter-weather","source_case_id":"sentence-056","split":"article"}}],"converter_output_used":false,"dataset":"blind-v2","id":"ready-gov-winter-weather-zh-hans-v1","input_only":true,"license":"U.S. Public Domain","modification_notice":"Extracted only complete Simplified Chinese paragraph and list-item sentences from the checksum-pinned Ready.gov main element, removed navigation, images, external resources, phone/URL instructions, page furniture, and exact duplicates, and added input-only provenance; no expected text or converter output was used.","purpose":"candidate_source_pilot","review_policy":"domain_and_risk_must_be_assigned_from_input_only","source_class":"public_domain","stats":{"by_split":{"article":56},"eligible_pending_review":56,"exclusions":{},"raw_cases":56},"upstream_revision":"Ready.gov Simplified Chinese Winter Weather; page last updated 2025-11-12; retrieved HTML SHA-256: 9411cc75dda88b6cc92408ca86ca7400f3e6cf46da02371243eea3124e42723b","version":1}
